    "name": "central_D2x_6_periodic_ast_fixture",
    "description": "AST-expansion conformance fixture for grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/central_D2x_6_periodic: a minimal consuming model binding NX=8, NY=4 at the import edge. The compound match D(D(u,x),x) fires (priority 10) through the section-9.6.3 fixpoint and lowers to the rule's makearray — interior columns [4,5] (all j) holding the imported 7-point sixth-order x second-difference stencil aggregate, the six x-face columns i in {1,2,3,6,7,8} over the (1 x NY) strips holding the sixth-order one-sided periodic closures (face1/face2/face3) no wall free names (periodic wrap) — with all metaparameters folded. x0=y0=0 and dx=1/8, dy=1/4; the dx/dy expressions are spelled with literals because the edge binding closes NX/NY before this document's scope (grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/grid.esm). The golden pins the byte-identical post-lowering AST across bindings.",
